# Copy to agents/.env (or export in your shell) before a non-dry run.
#
# The Anthropic API key each agent uses to make decisions. Without it, only
# --dry runs work (they use a deterministic stub instead of calling Claude).
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=

# Optional: override the Commander (oversight) model. Defaults to claude-opus-5.
# AI_STATION_MODEL=claude-opus-5

# Optional: override the desks' (high-frequency) model. Defaults to a cheaper,
# faster model since the two desks make far more decisions than the Commander.
# AI_STATION_WORKER_MODEL=claude-haiku-4-5
